{
  "_comment": [
    "The bundled font catalogue: one entry per FACE (family + weight + style).",
    "build.js reads this and writes fonts/<slug>.js plus FONT_INDEX in fonts.js.",
    "prepare_fonts.py reads the same file and rebuilds fonts/src/*.ttf from the zips.",
    "",
    "source is the zip and the member inside it that the face came from; a face",
    "that was already in src/ as a clean .ttf has source: null.",
    "",
    "license is provenance only: it records where the face came from. Nothing in",
    "the UI reads it, and no face is flagged or filtered on it."
